e.com/2026/11/20/intuit-sell-mailchimp-3-68-billion-ai-reshapes-growth-strategy-cfo/</guid></item><item><title>罗纳德·里根说过，如果你不关心功劳归谁，你就可以取得任何成就。阿卜杜勒·赛义德通过“特朗普关怀所有人”传达了这一智慧</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/22/ronald-reagan-adbul-el-sayed-trumpcare-for-all-medicare-aca-health-insurance-costs/</link><description>“除了唐纳德·特朗普之外，我们没有人跑步是为了命名事情。我们大多数人跑步是为了真正解决人们生活中的问题。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2292820015-e1795370079517.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 19:46:28 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/22/ronald-reagan-adbul-el-sayed-trumpcare-for-all-medicare-aca-health-insurance-costs/</guid></item><item><title>高端家谱旅游蓬勃发展，为您的家谱提供奢华之旅</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/22/high-end-genealogy-travel-luxury-family-tree-italy/</link><description>最独特的行程已写在您的 DNA 中。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/PAS_Italy-Genealogy_Horizontal.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 19:45:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/22/high-end-genealogy-travel-luxury-family-tree-italy/</guid></item><item><title>阿里巴巴和腾讯对中国芯片充满信心，因为美国的限制措施可能会减缓他们的人工智能发展</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/20/tencent-alibaba-us-chip-curbs-cloud-ai/</link><description>腾讯总裁刘炽平称这些限制“不幸”，并承认现在需要更长的时间来训练公司的下一个人工智能模型。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2304616249.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 12:44:51 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/20/tencent-alibaba-us-chip-curbs-cloud-ai/</guid></item><item><title>十几岁的时候，她是曼哈顿的一名保姆。现在，她经营着一家年收入 1 亿美元的人工智能初创公司，其客户包括亿万富翁科赫家族</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/22/tribe-ai-cofounder-ceo-jaclyn-rice-nelson-scaling-startup-100-million-revenue-career-success-koch-industries/</link><description>Tribe AI 首席执行官 Jaclyn Rice Nelson 充分利用了建立关系的技巧，成为一家价值 1 亿美元的人工智能初创公司，该公司的收入在一年内几乎翻了两番。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Nelson-TribeAI.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 11:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/22/tribe-ai-cofounder-ceo-jaclyn-rice-nelson-scaling-startup-100-million-revenue-career-success-koch-industries/</guid></item><item><title>您应该储备库存以应对停电吗？美国情报局长指出新冠疫情证明“美国是最神奇、最有弹性的地方”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/22/should-you-stock-up-to-prepare-for-outages-director-national-intelligence-jay-clayton-covid-resilience/</link><description>“你如何准备？知道系统将要升级。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2305191998-e1795365457792.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 17:43:35 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/22/should-you-stock-up-to-prepare-for-outages-director-national-intelligence-jay-clayton-covid-resilience/</guid></item><item><title>“时间不匹配”：数据中心电力需求每年增长 19%。电网增长2%</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/22/ai-data-centers-power-grid-capacity/</link><description>保险经纪人豪顿发现，自 2000 年以来，数据中心电力需求的增长速度是电网的 10 倍。选民刚刚收紧了压力，大型科技公司正在转向自己的天然气工厂。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2292181018.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 16:34:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/22/ai-data-centers-power-grid-capacity/</guid></item><item><title>Vertex执行董事长：行业10%到20%的药物试验成功率是这样的，我们是如何做到70%以上的</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/22/vertex-leiden-rd-success-rate-fewer-smarter-bets-innovation/</link><description>更多的赌注并不一定会带来更多的成功&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/jeffrey-leiden_6ea868.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 13:30:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/